;; SWd, clause 6: table 6.1.2.1.1-1, describing the Diameter-EAP-Request
;; printed for SWd in clause 6.2.2.1.1.1 under 16777250.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swd-der-mip6-feature-vector
; AVP: MIP6-Feature-Vector
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 6.2.2.1.1.1
; Section: 6.1.2.1.1
; Table: 6.1.2.1.1-1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The PMIP6_SUPPORTED flag and/or the GTPv2_SUPPORTED flag shall be set if the trusted non-3GPP access network supports PMIPv6 and/or GTPv2."
"The flag MIP6_INTEGRATED shall be set if DHCPv6 based Home Agent address discovery is supported as defined in IETF RFC 5447 [6]."
"The MIP4_SUPPORTED flag shall be set if the trusted non-3GPP access supports MIPv4 FA-CoA mode."
    text-only


;; The command's body prints no Transport-Access-Type: the row describes an AVP the
;; ABNF carries only as *[ AVP ], so no scope names the command.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swd-der-transport-access-type
; AVP: Transport-Access-Type
; Section: 6.1.2.1.1
; Table: 6.1.2.1.1-1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"if the access network needs to receive the IMSI of the UE in the authentication response, then this information element shall be present, and it shall contain the value \"BBF\" (see clause 5.2.3.19)."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swd-der-twan-connectivity-parameters
; AVP: TWAN-Connectivity-Parameters
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 6.2.2.1.1.1
; Section: 6.1.2.1.1
; Table: 6.1.2.1.1-1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be present if the 3GPP AAA Server has previously authorized the SCM to be used for EPC access."
"If the requested connectivity has been granted, the following information elements shall be included:"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swd-der-twag-cp-address
; AVP: TWAG-CP-Address
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 6.2.2.1.1.1
; Section: 6.1.2.1.1
; Table: 6.1.2.1.1-1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The TWAN shall include this IE if it indicates support of the MCM in the Supported TWAN Connection Modes IE."
    present-if TWAN-Connection-Mode bit MC-MODE


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swd-der-high-priority-access-info
; AVP: High-Priority-Access-Info
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777250
; Command-Section: 6.2.2.1.1.1
; Section: 6.1.2.1.1
; Table: 6.1.2.1.1-1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be sent to the 3GPP AAA Server if the UE has access priority"
    text-only


;; SWm, clause 7: the tables of clause 7.1.2, describing the commands of
;; clause 7.2.2 under 16777264.
;; An ePDG supporting emergency services sets Emergency-Services'
;; Emergency-Indication bit when the UE indicates one (the Emergency
;; Services row): the bit set says the UE did.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-der-service-selection
; AVP: Service-Selection
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be present if the ePDG has received an APN from the UE and the UE did not indicate the establishment of an emergency session in the IKEv2 signalling."
    text-only
"This AVP shall be absent if the UE indicated the establishment of an emergency session during the IKEv2 tunnel establishment"
    absent-if Emergency-Services bit Emergency-Indication


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-der-visited-network-identifier
; AVP: Visited-Network-Identifier
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be present if the ePDG is not in the UE's home network i.e. the UE is roaming."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-der-rat-type
; AVP: RAT-Type
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be present if the access type is known by the ePDG."
"When not known by the ePDG, this information element should be present and, in that case, it shall take the value VIRTUAL (1)."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-der-terminal-information
; AVP: Terminal-Information
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The ePDG shall include this IE and set it to the user's Mobile Equipment Identity, if this information is available."
"For an untrusted WLAN access, this grouped AVP shall contain the IMEI AVP and, if available, the Software-Version AVP."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-der-emergency-services
; AVP: Emergency-Services
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"An ePDG which supports emergency services shall include this information element, with the Emergency-Indication bit set, if the UE indicated the establishment of an emergency session during the IKEv2 tunnel establishment"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-der-high-priority-access-info
; AVP: High-Priority-Access-Info
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Based on operator policy, this information element shall be sent to the 3GPP AAA Server if the UE has access priority"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-eap-master-session-key
; AVP: EAP-Master-Session-Key
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present when Result Code is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-redirect-host
; AVP: Redirect-Host
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be sent if the Result-Code value is set to DIAMETER_REDIRECT_INDICATION."
    present-if Result-Code = DIAMETER_REDIRECT_INDICATION


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-apn-oi-replacement
; AVP: APN-OI-Replacement
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall only be included if NBM is used, the Emergency-Indication bit of the Emergency-Services AVP is not set in the Authentication and Authorization Request and the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-apn-configuration
; AVP: APN-Configuration
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS and the Emergency-Indication bit of the Emergency-Services AVP is not set in the Authentication and Authorization Request."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-trace-info
; AVP: Trace-Info
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be included if the subscriber and equipment trace has been activated for the user in the HSS and signalling based activation is used to download the trace activation from the HSS to the ePDG."
    text-only
"Only the Trace-Data AVP shall be included to the Trace-Info AVP"
    members only Trace-Data


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-subscription-id
; AVP: Subscription-Id
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall contain the MSISDN of the UE and shall be sent only if it is available."
    requires Subscription-Id/Subscription-Id-Type = END_USER_E164


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-mobile-node-identifier
; AVP: Mobile-Node-Identifier
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall be present if NBM is used."
"If this IE contains an identity based on IMSI, this IE shall not include the leading digit prepended in front of the IMSI used to differentiate between authentication schemes."
    text-only


;; The WLAN Location Information row maps to Access-Network-Info.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-user-location-info-time
; AVP: User-Location-Info-Time
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE should be present if the WLAN Location Information IE is present."
    present-if Access-Network-Info


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-emergency-info
; AVP: Emergency-Info
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall only be present if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS
"It shall be present for a non-roaming authenticated user, if this information was received from the HSS and if the Emergency-Services AVP is present, with the Emergency-Indication bit set, in the Authentication and Authorization Request."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-ue-usage-type
; AVP: UE-Usage-Type
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall be present if this information is available in the user subscription."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-core-network-restrictions
; AVP: Core-Network-Restrictions
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall be present if this information is available in the user subscription."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-dea-mps-priority
; AVP: MPS-Priority
; Command: Diameter-EAP-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.1.1
; Table: 7.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Based on operator policy, this information element shall be sent to the ePDG if the UE has an MPS subscription in the HSS."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-aar-ue-local-ip-address
; AVP: UE-Local-IP-Address
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall be present if the ePDG provided the UE Local IP address in the initial Authentication and Authorization Request and the UE Local IP address has changed."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-aar-high-priority-access-info
; AVP: High-Priority-Access-Info
; Command: AA-Request
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Based on operator policy, this information element shall be sent to the 3GPP AAA Server if the UE has access priority"
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-aaa-apn-oi-replacement
; AVP: APN-OI-Replacement
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall only be included if NBM is used, the Emergency-Indication bit of the Emergency-Services AVP was not set in the initial Authentication and Authorization Request, and the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-aaa-apn-configuration
; AVP: APN-Configuration
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This information element shall only be sent if the Result-Code AVP is set to DIAMETER_SUCCESS and the Emergency-Indication bit of the Emergency-Services AVP was not set in the initial Authentication and Authorization Request."
    requires Result-Code = DIAMETER_SUCCESS


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-aaa-trace-info
; AVP: Trace-Info
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall be included if the subscriber and equipment trace has been activated for the user in the HSS and signalling based activation is used to download the trace activation from the HSS to the ePDG."
    text-only
"Only the Trace-Data AVP shall be included if trace activation is requested. Only the Trace-Reference AVP shall be included if trace deactivation is requested."
    members only Trace-Data Trace-Reference


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-aaa-subscription-id
; AVP: Subscription-Id
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This AVP shall contain the MSISDN of the UE and shall be sent only if it is available."
    requires Subscription-Id/Subscription-Id-Type = END_USER_E164


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-aaa-user-location-info-time
; AVP: User-Location-Info-Time
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE should be present if the WLAN Location Information IE is present."
    present-if Access-Network-Info


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-aaa-core-network-restrictions
; AVP: Core-Network-Restrictions
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"This IE shall be present if this information is available in the user subscription."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: swm-aaa-mps-priority
; AVP: MPS-Priority
; Command: AA-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777264
; Section: 7.1.2.2.1
; Table: 7.1.2.2.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"Based on operator policy, this information element shall be sent to the ePDG if the UE has an MPS subscription in the HSS."
    text-only


;; The AVP clauses of 7.2.3.
