; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"In all other cases the PDN GW shall use its FQDN."
"The FA/3GPP AAA Server/HSS shall use FQDN if known."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: s6b-mip4-mip6-agent-info-home-link-prefix
; AVP: MIP6-Home-Link-Prefix
; Within: MIP6-Agent-Info
; Section: 9.2.3.6.2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"The AVP MIP6-Home-Link-Prefix is not used in S6b, but it is included here to reflect the complete IETF definition of the grouped AVP."
    text-only


