;; The 3GPP AAA Server/Proxy - EIR reference point, clause 11: the
;; answer is TS 29.272's ME-Identity-Check-Answer, which this file does
;; not print, so no scope names it; TS 29.272's file reads the same
;; condition of it.
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: eca-equipment-status
; AVP: Equipment-Status
; Section: 11.1.2.1.1
; Table: 11.1.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.6.0..19.2.0
"It shall be present if the result of the ME Identity Check is DIAMETER_SUCCESS."
    text-only
